# Collected Company puts Dauntless Bodyguard and Birds of Paradise onto the battlefield at the same time. The Bodyguard's
# creature is chosen before it enters (CR 614.12a), when the Birds are not on the battlefield yet, so they can't be chosen
# (the card's ruling); Ornithopter, already there, is.

